//   THE ROYAL CUT (!)          a long sweep of the rusted sword. A shield turns it, and a blocked cut throws him back reeling.
//   RISE FROM THE GRAVE (!!)   he goes into the floor, the dirt cracks toward you, and he comes up under where you stood.
//   CALL THE COURT             his courtiers claw up out of the tomb floor: two, and three past half.
//   THE CROWN (!)              thrown at head height, out and back like a blade; he is BAREHEADED, and bleeds, till he catches it.
//   SNUFF THE LAMPS (!!)       past half: a grave-wind that puts the tomb's lamps out and throws you off your feet. In the
